      "description": {
        "fun": "A rowdy city parrot with a punk's pompadour. Squawkabilly form noisy flocks of 50 or more by feather colour and squabble over territory, and the mornings and evenings when they go out looking for food get very loud. Green ones hold the most sway, since that colour is the most likely to be passed down. It's modelled on the monk parakeets that flock in Madrid and other Spanish cities.",
        "guide": "A Normal and Flying-type parrot Pokémon from Pokémon Scarlet and Violet, based on the monk parakeet. It comes in green, blue, yellow and white plumage, and each colour forms its own flocks. Paldea's flying taxis are carried by Squawkabilly.",
